*{{AC|file=LegionAudioTap3.mp3}} ''(For the entire transcription amongst the agents, see [[Range/Lore/V26#Cypher's Office 6|Range/Lore/V26 → v12.05 → Cypher's Office]].)''
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone133.mp3}} "Boss, listen up, I've got an issue and no one's taking it seriously. All the intercepts we're getting from [[Omega]], all the dirty details on this power play from [[Omega Viper|Viper]], and no one is asking the real question: why the hell did she choose [[Omega Sova|Sova]] as her second-in-command instead of me?! Listen, I don't like backstabbing either, but you pick your golden boy who always follows his conscience over the career criminal?! Are you out of your goddamn mind?! You know how many crews I've pulled together after someone decides to shake up the big boss? This shit is a regular occurrence in my field! Damn, sometimes these Omega guys really scramble my brain! Anyway, don't worry, I'm not planning to backstab you. I could, and I'd be the best at it! But I won't."

